OL,3,GNEWSAJack-knifed lorry closes stretch
OL,4,Aof A38
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jack-knifed lorry has closed part of
OL,7,Fthe A38 in Derbyshire.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police initially said the
OL,10,Froute was shut southbound between
OL,11,FLittle Eaton and Palm Court on Thursday
OL,12,Fafternoon, but has since confirmed the
OL,13,Fclosure is at the exit for Kilburn.
OL,15,FOfficers added one lane northbound is
OL,16,Falso closed as a result of the central
OL,17,Freservation being "damaged and pushed
OL,18,Finto the outside lane".
OL,20,FDrivers are being asked to avoid the
OL,21,Farea and take alternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
